 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "They are stubborn.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "Most men would have swum for the ships by now.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "They are waiting for help that is not coming.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And they are afraid to admit the great Company has been trapped by a king they thought was a petty chieftain.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Good fishing?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "ANTONY"
   ],
   "text": "Very good, Ayya. We found a supply boat coming in from a ship further out.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "ANTONY"
   ],
   "text": "It has a hole in its hull now. The rice is for the fish.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And the crew?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "ANTONY"
   ],
   "text": "Some swam. The sea is hungry tonight.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "ANTONY"
   ],
   "text": "They think big ships make them masters. But big ships must anchor. And anchors act like tethers for goats.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "ANTONY (off)"
   ],
   "text": "We swim out, we cut, we drill.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "ANTONY (off)"
   ],
   "text": "They are fighting the ocean, and the ocean is on our side.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "They are stubborn. Good officers, wasted on a merchant's war.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "They think they serve their nation.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "They serve a company.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Merchants who will check the cost of their rescue against the price of pepper, and decide they are too expensive.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Wake them up.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If the Dutch think we are sleeping, they might try a sortie.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "The magazine! They hit the powder room!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "They're coming out!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Hold!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Hold the centre!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "I am Eustachius De Lannoy. Captain of the Dutch East India Company.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "I speak for the garrison.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You speak for men who burned our temples and took our people as slaves.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Why should we listen?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Because dead men cannot teach you how to build what we just lost.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "And I would rather build than rot.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "They are done.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Yes. They are done.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "CAPTAIN"
   ],
   "text": "Shall we finish them?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "No.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Dead men cannot sign treaties. And they cannot teach us how to build what they just lost.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Let them simmer tonight. Let them taste the ash.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Tomorrow, we will see what remains.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  }
 ]
}